@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title DELETE /api/workspace/v1/messenger/stream_bindings/[binding_uuid]
actor "Клиент" as Client
participant "WorkspaceStreamBindingController\nRestAlchemy" as API
database "PostgreSQL\nканонические строки + привязки" as DB
queue "Transactional outbox\n+ вывод типизированных задач" as Outbox
participant "Фоновые исполнители\nexact scope leases + fencing" as Worker
database "Готовые проекции\nпривязки контейнеров" as Projection
database "Хранилище публичных событий" as Events
participant "Диспетчер WebSocket" as Dispatcher
actor "Клиент WebSocket" as WS
Client -> API: DELETE /api/workspace/v1/messenger/stream_bindings/{binding_uuid}
API -> DB: lock persistent USER_STREAM_BINDING\nactive=false; membership_generation++
API -> DB: immutable outbox event на каждую typed task
DB --> API: фиксация транзакции
API --> Client: успешный публичный ответ
DB ->> Outbox: зафиксированное событие
Outbox ->> Worker: topic_membership_policy_rebuild / read_counters /\nfolder_projection / delivery_snapshot_event\nкаждая task имеет своё outbox_event_uuid
Worker -> Worker: topic scope: скрыть placement access;\nuser-stream/user-folder: shared projections
Worker -> DB: conditional by active=false + new generation;\nstale generation = no-op
Worker -> Projection: оставшиеся привязки доступа/контейнеров
Worker -> Events: события удаления потока/привязки/папки\nатомарно в одной DB transaction с проекцией
Events ->> Dispatcher: зафиксированная готовая строка
Dispatcher ->> WS: отправка / повтор / воспроизведение
note over API,Worker
  После commit все message/reaction paths требуют active membership
  и generation equality; cleanup старых rows не security boundary.
  Task lifecycle: lease expiry/fencing, retry/backoff, DLQ/reaper.
end note
@enduml
